msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.33.3.1, an emergency release for the 3.33 LTS "
"stream."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release fixes the following CVE:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-16308[CVE-2026-16308] - Quarkus "
"REST denial of service via unbounded multipart MIME part-header accumulation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It also fixes a native image regression introduced by the Netty upgrade in 3."
"33.3."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.33."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.33, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.33."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.33.3.1[the "
"full changelog of 3.33.3.1 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
